=== P3/A1/0001 — Design tokens → Material 3 Theme.kt ===

=== PREFLIGHT ===
Predecessor P3/A0 (android scaffold): STATUS=DONE
  (.github/prompts/monorepo/logs/p3-a0-0001-android-scaffold.log: EXIT=0 / STATUS=DONE).
Predecessor P1/S9 (design tokens) + P0/0003 (version lock): present and consumed.
Runner: Windows_NT; JDK 21 (Android Studio JBR); Node 24; Android SDK platforms 34/35/36,
  build-tools 36.1.0; Gradle 8.14.5 wrapper. Baseline `:android:assembleDebug` = BUILD SUCCESSFUL
  before changes (existing hand-seeded A0 theme).
Working tree before changes: only the hand-seeded A0 theme (Color.kt/Type.kt/Theme.kt) under
  apps/android plus committed monorepo logs; no apps/design/generated/android yet.

=== SURVEY ===
Source tokens: apps/design/tokens.json (frozen P1/S9 set) — color(light/dark/highContrast + status),
  chart(categorical[8] + series[6]), typography(8 roles + weights), spacing(scale[9]), radius[4],
  elevation(levels[4] + material map), motion(durations[3] + easing[3]).
Canonical pattern (from P2/W1 Windows): a dedicated per-platform generator reads tokens.json and
  emits to apps/design/generated/<platform>/**; the app consumes the generated artifacts. The
  apps/design/generators/*.mjs prototype is vestigial (the real Windows Tokens.xaml does not match
  gen-fluent.mjs and index.mjs --check is not a passing gate) and is outside the allowed files.
Version lock: apps/versions.lock.md — Compose BOM 2026.04.01, Material 3 1.4.0, Kotlin 2.4.0,
  AGP 8.9.2. Honored (no floated versions). detekt was required by apps-android CI
  (`./gradlew ktlintCheck detekt lint`) but not yet wired in — added at 1.23.8.

=== REASONING ===
- Generator lives in apps/android/buildSrc (compiled, reusable build logic) so the ~330-line
  deterministic transform stays out of the app's ktlint/detekt surface. Pure string building →
  byte-stable output → checkDesignTokensDrift is a true regeneration gate and generate is idempotent.
- M3 ColorScheme roles are mapped from semantic tokens; translucent glass/border tokens are
  alpha-flattened over the opaque surface so surfaceVariant/outline are solid colors derived from
  tokens (no library-baseline brand colors, no hand-picked hexes). HighContrast uses the
  lightColorScheme builder (white bg / black text). 15 M3 type slots are filled from the 8-role ramp.
- TeslaSyncTheme defaults to the brand schemes; Material You dynamicColor is opt-in (Android 12+),
  so brand identity ships by default. highContrast selects the accessibility palette. Status colors
  flow through LocalStatusColors; the theme-invariant ChartPalette is exposed via TeslaTokens.
- Generated files are committed under apps/design/generated/android/** (force-added past the broad
  apps/**/generated/ ignore, mirroring the committed Windows Tokens.xaml; .gitignore is out of scope).
  They are added to the main Kotlin source set and ktlint-excluded; detekt's default source
  (src/main|test) never sees them.

=== CHANGES ===
NEW apps/android/buildSrc/{build.gradle.kts, src/main/kotlin/io/teslasync/android/buildlogic/
    DesignTokenGenerator.kt} — deterministic tokens.json → Kotlin generator (generate + drift + render).
NEW apps/design/generated/android/io/teslasync/android/ui/theme/generated/{GeneratedColor,
    GeneratedType, GeneratedShape, GeneratedDimens, GeneratedMotion}.kt — generated theme layer:
    Light/Dark/HighContrast ColorScheme, StatusColors (×3 themes), ChartPalette, GeneratedTypography
    (15 slots), GeneratedShapes + Radius, Spacing + Elevation, MotionDurations + MotionEasing.
NEW apps/android/config/detekt/detekt.yml — Compose-friendly detekt config (buildUponDefaultConfig).
EDIT apps/android/gradle/libs.versions.toml — add detekt 1.23.8 version + plugin alias.
EDIT apps/android/build.gradle.kts — register detekt plugin (apply false).
EDIT apps/android/app/build.gradle.kts — apply detekt + config; generateDesignTokens /
    checkDesignTokensDrift tasks; preBuild dependency; main source set += generated dir;
    ktlint filter excludes the generated layer.
REWRITE apps/android/app/.../ui/theme/Theme.kt — TeslaSyncTheme(darkTheme, highContrast,
    dynamicColor=false) consuming generated schemes/typography/shapes + status CompositionLocal.
NEW apps/android/app/.../ui/theme/ThemeTokens.kt — LocalStatusColors + TeslaTokens accessor.
NEW apps/android/app/.../ui/theme/ThemeShowcase.kt — showcase composable + 4 @Preview variants
    (light, dark, high-contrast, dynamic-color-disabled/brand).
DELETE apps/android/app/.../ui/theme/{Color.kt, Type.kt} — A0 placeholders replaced by the generated layer.
NEW apps/android/app/src/test/.../ui/theme/GeneratedThemeTest.kt — unit tests: token parsing,
    light/dark/high-contrast role completeness, typography/shape mapping, chart/status exposure.

